     <property name="text">
      <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Dataset and the corresponding labels of this project are defined here. The dataset is defined as the total number of GC-IMS spectra used in this project. Each of these spectra must be assigned to a label of your choice. For exampel: If you are analyzing different honey spectra, you would use the destinct honey types as labels, such as ‚canola‘, ‚acacia‘ ,manuka‘ ... ect. Correct labeling is of uttermost importance, since the calssification algorithm needs this information to work properly!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
     </property>
